Copyright (c) 2026 Michael Lee Lupton. All rights reserved.

This license covers the Flattoo repository: its Nix expressions, modules,
scripts, tools, generated wallpapers and marks, documentation and help
pages (the "Software"). It does not cover the third-party components the
Software builds on (NixOS, nixpkgs, Krita, XFCE, picom, whisper.cpp and
the rest); each of those stays under its own license, listed in NOTICE.

1. DEFINITIONS

   "Principal Holder" means the person or entity holding the largest
   ownership interest in the Flattoo project, as recorded in Schedule A.
   On the date of this version that is Michael Lee Lupton. A change of
   the Principal Holder is made by amending Schedule A in the official
   repository, signed by the outgoing Principal Holder.

   "Flattoo System Design" means the specific combination this Software
   implements and documents: a NixOS flake as the whole of a laptop
   (one repository is the machine, nightly signed upgrades, rollback by
   boot entry); a plain-language assistant restricted to a fixed allowlist
   of actions with a privileged helper behind polkit and an optional model
   that may only choose among those actions; the network edge of
   prefix-sanity filtering, a validating resolver with encrypted upstreams
   and local reverse zones, and a dispatcher that keeps DNS working on
   captive networks; the minimal-and-robust footing (no terminal for the
   user, every change declarative, every tool tested offline); and the
   looks engine, lock, show-a-client, shop-display and keyboard-free
   provisions, as a system for a non-technical professional's work
   machine.

   "Commercial Use" means selling, licensing, renting or offering for a fee
   the Software or a derivative of it; preinstalling it on hardware that is
   sold; offering it as a hosted, managed or supported service; or using
   it to deliver a paid product whose value is the Flattoo System Design.

   "You" means anyone exercising rights under this license.

